review_text:
One of the best standalone expansions I've ever played, heavily inspired by 80s action movies, with a great sense of humor and fun gameplay. This game comes from a long forgotten time when publishers and developers were not afraid to experiment and innovate. Unfortunately, we'll probably never see a proper sequel, because we don't deserve it. Strongly recommended if you have a craving for cheesy one-liners and over-the-top 80s action.

Pros:
- Great art design and visuals;
- Awesome soundtrack;
- Cool arsenal;
- Hilarious writing;
- Responsive controls;
- Fun gunplay;
- Great voice acting;
- Good optimisation;
- Neon-drenched post-apocalyptic atmosphere;
- Great sound design;

Cons:
- Ubisoft Connect(Upaly) is complete garbage;
- Some bugs;
- A little too short;
